@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token = replace-with-user-jwt
@documentId = replace-with-import-response-documentId

### Import caller-supplied UTF8 bytes; no drive file or URL is read
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/rag/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"trash.txt","contentBase64":"RGVsZXRlZCBmaWxlcyBhcmUgbW92ZWQgaW50byB0aGUgcmVjeWNsZSBiaW4gZm9yIHRoaXJ0eSBkYXlzLiBVc2VycyBjYW4gcmVzdG9yZSBkZWxldGVkIGZpbGVzIGR1cmluZyB0aGlzIHJldGVudGlvbiBwZXJpb2Qu"}

### List the JWT owner's volatile corpus
GET {{gateway}}/api/ai/rag/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Local ONNX retrieval; no API key or external-processing consent required
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/rag/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"How long are deleted files kept in the recycle bin?"}

### Generation requires AI enabled plus explicit consent
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/rag/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"How long are deleted files kept in the recycle bin?","allowExternalProcessing":true}

### Out-of-corpus question: expected REFUSED / NO_EVIDENCE, no provider call
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/rag/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"Who composed the opera The Magic Flute?","allowExternalProcessing":true}

### Missing consent: expected 400 before generation
POST {{gateway}}/api/ai/rag/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"How long are deleted files kept in the recycle bin?","allowExternalProcessing":false}

### Delete owned document, expected 204; other-owner / unknown id always 404
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/ai/rag/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
